      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Absent by design.** These reconciliation metrics are named in the Phase 32 contract but are not produced by the running Service (verified Phase 33.3 s2):\n\n- `irandirect.runtime.observe.duration` - no instrument in production code, so no observation-duration panel is shown.\n- `irandirect.runtime.repairs.with_changes` / `.no_changes` - no instrument. The **no-change ratio** panel below is derived from `irandirect_runtime_cycles_completed_total{outcome=\"no_change\"}`, which *is* emitted, and is the faithful substitute.\n- `irandirect.routes.operations.failed` - instrumented but never observed in the sampled window; the failures panel will populate on the first failing system call.\n\nNo `failure_category`, `route_kind` or `change_kind` label exists on any live series, so panels keyed on those labels are omitted rather than written against labels that would never match."
      }
